# The POUs of doc/beedance_basic.st that stclean -refs comments out, and why:
# beedance does not run them yet. The POUs that use them follow. main_test.go checks the doc file against this one.
_BUFFER_CLEAR it computes with pointers as addresses (pt := pt + 1); beedance references (REF_TO) have no arithmetic.
_BUFFER_INIT it computes with pointers as addresses (pt := pt + 1); beedance references (REF_TO) have no arithmetic.
_STRING_TO_BUFFER it reads or writes the bytes of a STRING through a pointer; a beedance reference (REF_TO) refers to a whole variable of its type.
BUFFER_SEARCH it reads or writes the bytes of a STRING through a pointer; a beedance reference (REF_TO) refers to a whole variable of its type.
BUFFER_TO_STRING it computes with pointers as addresses (pt := pt + 1); beedance references (REF_TO) have no arithmetic.
TEMP_PT it reads the bits of a REAL as a DWORD, or back, through a pointer; a beedance reference (REF_TO) refers to a variable of its own type.
LIST_CLEAN it reads or writes the bytes of a STRING through a pointer; a beedance reference (REF_TO) refers to a whole variable of its type.
